*---------------------- METADATA FIELD

#TITLE Extended Directive Payloads
#SUBTITLE Structurally valid #EXWAV / #EXBMP / #ARGB / #BGA / #SWBGA / #WAVCMD / #EXRANK payloads
#ARTIST be-music
#GENRE TEST
#BPM 120
#PLAYLEVEL 1
#TOTAL 200
#DIFFICULTY 1

*---------------------- EXTENDED HEADER FIELD
* `four-measure-command-combo-test.bms` proves the parser ROUTES every extended
* header into the right `bms` field, but its payloads are placeholders
* (`#EXWAV01 ex_sample.wav`, `#BGA01 01`, `#SWBGA01 02`, `#WAVCMD legacy`) that
* every `@be-music/chart` value parser rejects. This chart carries the same
* directive family with payloads that actually parse, so the value parsers are
* exercised against a real file instead of inline strings only.
*
* Payload layouts (hitkey BMS Memo):
*   #EXWAVxx <flags> <params> <filename>  flags drawn from `pvf`, params positional
*   #EXBMPxx a,r,g,b,filename             ARGB tuple plus the image filename
*   #ARGBxx AARRGGBB | a,r,g,b            both accepted spellings
*   #BGAxx YY x1 y1 x2 y2 dx dy           sub-region crop of #BMPYY
*   #SWBGAxx fr:tot:lp[:ARGB] N1 N2 ...   switching (animated) BGA, fr in 1/100 s
*   #WAVCMD pp xx vv                      pp = 00 pitch / 01 volume / 02 loop
*   #EXRANKxx <percent>                   judge-window scale, cued on channel A0
*   #CHANGEOPTIONxx <option>              runtime option switch, cued on channel A6

#PLAYER 1
#LNTYPE 1
#VOLWAV 90
#DEFEXRANK 100
#STP 001.500
#STP 002.250

* Per-slot playback trims. `01` uses the full `pvf` layout, `02` reorders the
* flags to prove they are matched positionally, `03` authors an explicit 0 cB
* (unity) so "authored 0" stays distinguishable from "not authored".
#EXWAV01 pvf 1024,-200,48000 sample.wav
#EXWAV02 vp -600,-500 branch.wav
#EXWAV03 v 0 right.wav

* Opaque backdrop keyed to transparent black, plus a half-alpha layer tint.
#EXBMP01 255,0,0,0,bga-base.bmp
#EXBMP02 128,255,255,255,bga-layer.bmp

* Both #ARGBxx spellings: AARRGGBB hex and comma-separated decimal.
#ARGB01 FF000000
#ARGB02 128,255,0,0

* Sub-region aliases: `05` is the whole of #BMP01, `06` is a 128x128 crop of
* #BMP02 drawn at (16, 8) inside the 256x256 BMS canvas.
#BGA05 01 0 0 256 256 0 0
#BGA06 02 64 32 192 160 16 8

* Animated BGA cues: `01` loops five frames at 100 ms, `02` plays three frames
* at 50 ms once and holds the last one (lp = 0).
#SWBGA01 10:5:1:FF000000 01 02 03 04 05
#SWBGA02 5:3:0 01 02 03

* One line per parameter byte so all three #WAVCMD params are covered.
#WAVCMD 01 01 64
#WAVCMD 00 02 12
#WAVCMD 02 03 1024

* Dynamic judge windows referenced from channel A0: tighter (48 %) then looser
* (150 %) than the #DEFEXRANK baseline.
#EXRANK01 48
#EXRANK02 150

#CHANGEOPTION01 MIRROR
#CHANGEOPTION02 RANDOM

*---------------------- RESOURCES FIELD

#WAV01 sample.wav
#WAV02 branch.wav
#WAV03 right.wav
#BMP01 bga-base.bmp
#BMP02 bga-layer.bmp
#BMP03 bga-poor.bmp

*---------------------- MEASURE LENGTH FIELD

*---------------------- OBJECT DATA FIELD

* Measure 0 - plain quarter taps so the chart stays playable while the header
* directives above are what is actually under test.
#00011:01010101

* Measure 1 - #EXRANKxx cued on channel A0 (dynamic judge window) and
* #CHANGEOPTIONxx cued on channel A6 (runtime option switch). Neither channel
* triggers a keysound.
#001A0:0102
#001A6:0102
#00111:01010101

* Measure 2 - BGA base (04), layer (07), layer2 (0A) and POOR (06) cues. Base
* and layer reference the #BGAxx sub-region slots, layer2 references the
* #SWBGAxx animation slot.
#00204:05
#00207:06
#0020A:01
#00206:03
#00211:01010101

